                "text": "At this point, it looks like Republicans\u2019 idea of a \u201cCommitment to America\u201d is to slash critical programs millions have earned and rely on (i.e. Social Security and Medicare), and help the rich get richer instead \ud83d\udcb0\n\nDemocrats, by contrast, are fighting to protect them.",
