                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Native women earn just 51 CENTS per dollar paid to white men in this country.\n \n#EquityForNativeWomen requires equal pay AND an end to systemic violence, poverty & healthcare disparities, & much more. Only with an eye on full equity can we end racism-based economic injustice.",
