                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "It is irresponsible & reckless to threaten to default on US debt to force the cutting of Social Security & Medicare, 2 of the most popular & successful govt programs in history. Let\u2019s be clear: this is an attack on our most vulnerable communities.\n\nThis is low\u2014even for the @GOP.",
