                "retweet_count": 35,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Ahead of #SOTU, let\u2019s be clear on the biggest threat to our economic progress: the @GOP.\n\nTheir economic plan?\n\n\u2014Cut Social Security & Medicare\n\u2014Raise taxes\u00a0on working people w/a 30% national sales tax\n\u2014Worsen inflation & raise the deficit by letting rich tax cheats off the hook",
