                "retweet_count": 73,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Imagine trying to push a policy so unpopular that the only way you can think to get it done is by threatening to crash the entire economy.\n\nThat\u2019s what Republicans are doing right now: threatening default for the first time in history in order to gut Social Security and Medicare.",
