                "retweet_count": 62,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Here\u2019s what women could buy each year if the wage gap didn't exist:\n\n\ud83c\udfe29+ additional months of rent\n\ud83e\uddf812 more months of child care\n\ud83d\uded212+ additional months of groceries\n\ud83e\ude7a7 additional months of premiums for employer-based health insurance\n\nWe must end the wage gap. #EqualPayDay",
