                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Big news: @POTUS has announced the first set of drugs selected for Medicare price negotiation.\n\nBig Pharma has blocked this for decades, but thanks to the #InflationReductionAct seniors are finally going to start seeing lower costs for the quality health care they need & deserve.",
