                "text": "On #VeteransDay, we honor those who served. As the daughter of a veteran, Lt. Col Garvin A. Tutt, I am deeply grateful to all our servicemembers & will keep fighting to make sure veterans receive world-class healthcare, disability benefits, & the support they have earned. https://t.co/6K70iO1Ufi",
