                "text": "Dreamers deserve full certainty they can build a life in the only country they've ever known\u2014and that includes having access to healthcare.\n\nMy colleagues & I are calling on @POTUS to finalize a rule to expand healthcare for DACA recipients. The time to enact this policy is now. https://t.co/3erPsfhefJ",
